kind: llman.sdd.spec
name: "cli-entry"
purpose: "TBD - created by archiving change c110-update-slash-commands. Update purpose after archive."
valid_scope[2]: src/,tests/
requirements[15]{req_id,title,statement}:
  sc1,"info-fields",SlashCommandInfo MUST carry name description source and source_info fields.
  sc2,"source-enum",SlashCommandSource MUST be exactly one of extension prompt or skill.
  sc3,"builtin-table",System MUST provide the full builtin slash command table matching pi semantics including export compact tree fork and reload.
  sc4,dispatch,AgentSession MUST dispatch slash commands via dispatch_slash_command routing to the matching handler.
  ce1,"app-directory","The CLI module MUST live under src/app/cli/, and the print mode MUST live under src/app/cli/print as a CLI sub-mode (not as a top-level app module). app/ modules MUST depend only on agent::facade and protocol/ (and, for the composition roots, runtime_protocol ports), never on agent::runtime, agent::session, or agent::tools directly."
  ce2,"no-silent-fallback","When a config file is present but yields zero loadable models (e.g. wrong key like 'model:' instead of 'models:'), the CLI MUST emit a clear error pointing at the config instead of silently falling back to environment-variable defaults. Silent fall-through to placeholder defaults is forbidden."
  ce6,"driver-abstraction","System MUST provide an app::Driver trait that app/cli (and future tui/web) depend on; an InProcessDriver (composition root wiring agent ports) and a RemoteDriver (WebSocket+REST client) MUST both implement it; switching local vs remote MUST require changing only the Driver constructor, not the event-handling code."
  ce7,"composition-root-ports","The in-process composition root (app::cli) MUST construct Arc<dyn SessionStore> and Arc<dyn EventSink> from concrete infra types and pass them to facade::Agent::new; the RPC run entry MUST also accept the store and sink for constructing Agent."
  ce8,"server-subcommands","The CLI MUST provide subcommands under server: run (start the server process with optional --port), install (register as launchd/systemd service), and stop (signal the running server via SIGTERM to its PID from the lock file)."
  ce9,"assembly-via-bootstrap","cli/mod.rs::run MUST NOT inline agent assembly; it MUST call app::core::bootstrap to obtain a constructed agent, and server/runtime.rs MUST also call app::core::bootstrap with resource discovery (context_files, append_system_prompt) enabled so server no longer ships a simplified headless copy."
  ce10,"dispatch-via-shared","tui/commands.rs MUST NOT carry its own Command variant execution logic; it MUST delegate to app::core::dispatch so that SetModel/CycleModel/Abort/Compact/GetState and all other Command variants execute via the shared Driver-backed dispatcher."
  ce11,"rpc-removed","The stdio RPC mode (src/app/rpc.rs, the --rpc CLI flag, the rpc cargo feature, and rpc1-rpc5 requirements) MUST be removed; the prior rpc implementation violated spec ip4 (it was a 784-line heavy dispatcher, not the thin stdio transport ip4 mandated) and had zero external consumers and zero real dispatch test coverage. Server WS/REST covers the remote/embedded use case rpc claimed."
  ce12,"default-tui-entry","当未提供 one-shot prompt（位置参数或 --prompt）、未指定 --list-models、且 stdin 为 TTY 时，CLI MUST 进入产品 TUI；MUST NOT 要求用户传 --tui 才能进入该默认路径。"
  ce13,"print-requires-prompt","print one-shot 模式 MUST 仅在提供位置 PROMPT 和/或 --prompt（或显式 --print 且能从 stdin 读到非空内容）时进入；无 prompt 时 MUST NOT 使用占位字符串 Hello! 作为默认 prompt。"
  "ce-st1","session-tree-kind-api","Driver MUST 暴露以 SessionTreeKind 区分的会话树 API：session_tree(kind) 读取该 kind 的树；travel_session_tree(kind, entry_id) 在该 kind 上旅行并返回 SessionTreeTravel（含 leaf_id 与可选 editor_text）。首版 MUST 至少实现 MessageHistory；未实现的 kind MUST 返回明确错误且 MUST NOT 静默落到其它 kind。InProcessDriver 与 RemoteDriver MUST 同面实现（Remote 经 REST）。应用面缝类型 MUST NOT 仅为品牌加 Xy 前缀。"
scenarios[21]{req_id,id,given,when,then}:
  sc1,fields,a command originates from a skill,the command is queried,source is skill and source_info is set
  sc2,"source-values",command sources are enumerated,the set is inspected,values are extension prompt or skill only
  sc3,"builtin-table",builtin commands are listed,the table is inspected,it includes export compact tree fork and reload
  sc4,"dispatch-compact",user types compact in a session,dispatch_slash_command is invoked,the compaction handler runs
  sc4,"dispatch-export",user types export in a session,dispatch_slash_command is invoked,the export handler runs
  ce1,"cli-under-app",the source tree is inspected,src/app/cli is inspected,"src/app/cli exists, print mode lives under src/app/cli (not src/app/print), and src/interface does not exist"
  ce2,"typo-error","","config.yaml is present but its models map is empty due to a typo (model: vs models:)",the CLI errors out with a message referencing the config file rather than silently using a placeholder default
  ce6,"same-handler-both-drivers",an app client event handler is written once,it is run against InProcessDriver then RemoteDriver,both produce identical event sequences for the same input
  ce7,"cli-constructs-ports","app::cli::run is traced",the agent construction is inspected,"Agent::new receives Arc<dyn SessionStore> and Arc<dyn EventSink>"
  ce8,"server-stop-signals",a server is running with a lock file containing PID 12345,xylitol server stop is run,SIGTERM is sent to PID 12345 and the lock file is cleaned up
  ce9,"server-gets-runtime-resource-discovery",a server run with an AGENTS.md present in cwd,"server/runtime.rs calls app::core::bootstrap","context_files and append_system_prompt are discovered and injected into the agent, matching print mode behavior (no longer headless-skipped)"
  ce9,"print-unchanged",print mode before and after c336,the same prompt is run,"the output is byte-identical (assembly path下沉 does not change print behavior)"
  ce10,"tui-model-works",the TUI is running,the user types /model to cycle or /model <id> to set,"the model is switched via app::core::dispatch (not a stub error)"
  ce11,"rpc-files-gone",the source tree is inspected after c336,"src/app/rpc.rs, the --rpc flag in CliArgs, the rpc cargo feature, and tests/features/rpc.feature are checked",none of them exist (rpc mode fully removed)
  ce12,"bare-tty-tui",stdin 为 TTY 且无 prompt,运行 xylitol,"进入 app::tui::run"
  ce13,"prompt-flag-print","","xylitol --prompt hi",进入 print 且 prompt 为 hi
  ce13,"no-hello-fallback",非 TTY 且无 prompt,运行 xylitol,以错误退出且不运行 Hello!
  "ce-st1","message-history-tree",当前 session 含父子 message 条目,调用 session_tree(MessageHistory),返回非空 SessionTreeNode 树且反映 parent/child
  "ce-st1","travel-user-prefill",MessageHistory 树中选中 user 消息节点,"调用 travel_session_tree(MessageHistory, that_id)",SessionTreeTravel.leaf_id 为父（或约定根策略）、editor_text 含该 user 正文
  "ce-st1","travel-non-user",选中非 user 节点,"travel_session_tree(MessageHistory, id)",leaf_id 为选中 id 且 editor_text 为空
  "ce-st1","unsupported-kind",传入尚未实现的 SessionTreeKind,调用 session_tree 或 travel_session_tree,返回明确错误且不修改 leaf
